{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PRO",
  "chapter": 5,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PRO.5.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.5.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My son, attend unto my wisdom;\nIncline thine ear to my understanding:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.5.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.5.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That thou mayest preserve discretion,\nAnd that thy lips may keep knowledge.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.5.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.5.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the lips of a strange woman drop honey,\nAnd her mouth is smoother than oil:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.5.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.5.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But in the end she is bitter as wormwood,\nSharp as a two-edged sword.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.5.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.5.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Her feet go down to death;\nHer steps take hold on Sheol;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.5.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.5.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So that she findeth not the level path of life:\nHer ways are unstable, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " she knoweth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.5.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.5.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now therefore, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "my",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " sons, hearken unto me,\nAnd depart not from the words of my mouth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.5.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.5.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Remove thy way far from her,\nAnd come not nigh the door of her house;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.5.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.5.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Lest thou give thine honor unto others,\nAnd thy years unto the cruel;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.5.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.5.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Lest strangers be filled with thy strength,\nAnd thy labors ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the house of an alien,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.5.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.5.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And thou mourn at thy latter end,\nWhen thy flesh and thy body are consumed,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.5.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.5.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And say, How have I hated instruction,\nAnd my heart despised reproof;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.5.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.5.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Neither have I obeyed the voice of my teachers,\nNor inclined mine ear to them that instructed me!",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.5.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.5.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I was well-nigh in all evil\nIn the midst of the assembly and congregation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.5.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.5.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Drink waters out of thine own cistern,\nAnd running waters out of thine own well.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.5.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.5.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Should thy springs be dispersed abroad,\nAnd streams of water in the streets?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.5.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.5.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let them be for thyself alone,\nAnd not for strangers with thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.5.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.5.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let thy fountain be blessed;\nAnd rejoice in the wife of thy youth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.5.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.5.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a loving hind and a pleasant doe,\nLet her breasts satisfy thee at all times;\nAnd be thou ravished always with her love.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.5.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.5.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For why shouldest thou, my son, be ravished with a strange woman,\nAnd embrace the bosom of a foreigner?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.5.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.5.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the ways of man are before the eyes of Jehovah;\nAnd he maketh level all his paths.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.5.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.5.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "His own iniquities shall take the wicked,\nAnd he shall be holden with the cords of his sin.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.5.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.5.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He shall die for lack of instruction;\nAnd in the greatness of his folly he shall go astray.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ]
}
